  <activity-date iso-date="2022-06-01" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">While some initial activities did take place as of the planned start date, the implementation of other activities that included traveling where postponned to 2023, as there were COVID-19 restrictions in 2022 that did not allow specific activities to take place.</narrative>
  </activity-date>
  <activity-date iso-date="2024-12-31" type="3">
